                "content": "LANDSCAPE SYSTEMS (10 visible):\n- workday.hcm: HCM - compensation agents only, NO REST API for staffing data\n- sap.sf: SuccessFactors HCM - REST API: EmployeeCompensationManagement:v1 (READ payroll/compensation data). KEY AGENT: SkillsAndCapabilityMatchingOrchestrator:v1 for workforce capability assessment\n- sap.s4: ERP - MaterialReceiptInboundAPI (INBOUND REST API for goods receipt), Procurement agents (ProcurementMatchingAgent), OpportunityToOrderAutomationEngine, AssetLifecycleChangeOrchestrator. OpportunityToOrderAutomationEngine description mentions \"inventory availability\"\n- sap.crm: CRM - sales/marketing agents ONLY - NO performance analytics APIs\n- sap.ehs: Safety/health - AGENTS for vendor safety compliance: VendorComplianceAutomationOrchestrator (validates vendor safety certifications and EHS compliance status), SafetyComplianceAutomationCoordinator\n- sap.ariba: Procurement - PurchaseOrderNetworkAPI (REST API for PO lifecycle, creation, approval, real-time status tracking - COVERS SPENDING COMMITMENTS), VendorInvoiceReconciliation, SourceingCampaignAndAccountManagementAPI\n- corp.itsm: IT service mgmt - agents ONLY - NO create API for maintenance submission\n- emarsys.cx: CX/marketing - agents only\n- my.mes: Manufacturing - EquipmentOEEAnalytics, ProductionQualityMonitor\n- siemens.plm: PLM - SupplierQualificationAndMaterialCoordinator (vendor assessment + material approval), EngineeringChangeAndMaterialProvisioning (agent with allocate-inventory capability), BOMComplianceValidator\n- sap.odm: Data model (entity taxonomy only)\n\nINVENTORY NOTES: SAP S/4 mentions inventory availability in OpportunityToOrderAutomationEngine but specific inventory API not yet identified. Need to look for MaterialStock/InventoryAPI or similar in SAP S/4. siemens.plm EngineeringChangeAndMaterialProvisioning agent has allocate-inventory capability but is agent-based."
